### Configuración de Variables Globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ==========================================
### 1. MÓDULO DE AUTENTICACIÓN (AUTH)
### ==========================================

### Generar JWT con las credenciales del .env
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### ==========================================
### 2. MÓDULO DE AUTORES (AUTHORS)
### ==========================================

### Listar todos los autores con paginación y búsqueda (GET /)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors?search=Gabriel&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Obtener un autor por ID (GET /:id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors/3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Crear un nuevo autor (POST /)
POST {{baseUrl}}/authors/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gabriel García Márquez",
  "biography": "Escritor y periodista colombiano, premio Nobel de Literatura en 1982."
}

###

### Actualizar un autor parcialmente (PUT /:id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/authors/3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "biography": "Escritor, periodista y guionista colombiano galardonado con el Nobel."
}

###

### Eliminar un autor por ID (DELETE /:id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/authors/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}